node_modules/

# The repo root ignores `**/package-lock.json` and `.npmrc` (pnpm-only policy).
# This fixture is the documented npm carve-out — see the "Package manager" note
# in the root AGENTS.md — so `.npmrc` is tracked here on purpose.
!.npmrc

# The pins live in package-lock.fixture.json, which IS tracked; they keep the
# install closure and the zero-tolerance watchlist counts from drifting on
# upstream point releases. The harness stages that file as package-lock.json
# for the install and deletes it afterwards, so the name npm needs stays
# ignored: this fixture installs `tinacms`, so a lockfile of its whole closure
# committed under a name scanners recognise reads as ~1400 newly-introduced
# dependencies, and fails on advisories the diff never introduced.
package-lock.json
